{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":261273,\"title\":\"Toxin\",\"tagline\":\"Millions infected, countless dead, and the lucky few survivors struggling to find the last safe corner for humanity.\",\"overview\":\"Lieutenant John Paxton wants revenge against the government he and his men swore their lives to defend. The very government that abandoned and betrayed him, leaving him to die after a secret biological warfare experiment went horribly wrong. John will discover revenge is a journey that will ultimately leave millions infected, countless dead, and the lucky few survivors struggling to find the last safe corner for humanity.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o8L2HRl1uj9S7SY4R2dEBehTSaH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fPeyGlbWhhyqcZFhR8M9vTjjGIa.jpg\",\"rating\":3.1,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":2014,\"runtime\":72,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"},{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Tom Raycove\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1319649,\"name\":\"Tom Raycove\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1081488,\"name\":\"Doug Chapman\",\"character\":\"Lt. John Paxton\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/woJlBx2I4Hv1nKkC8f1G5cXqvXu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1261375,\"name\":\"Kyra Zagorsky\",\"character\":\"Carla Frye\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o5rrqfRe3CpNHYvilhJT1p82F0z.jpg\"},{\"id\":64670,\"name\":\"Philip Granger\",\"character\":\"Colonel Donald Magnusson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkrnrtSiUnumWVpAOy5QDcOePiA.jpg\"},{\"id\":67843,\"name\":\"Lloyd Adams\",\"character\":\"Helicopter Soldier\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1381071,\"title\":\"Godzilla Minus Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSmIJluOJmTWvJs4d7kHRxjc8s8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqrYIDH4tvfEzPe1yqT4jzmAWHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1375646,\"title\":\"Colony\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/enz3WLx5QU1FUyhXZld04QWIc6N.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iGViga8sDCET1S6GfwOlAbuhSGQ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315011,\"title\":\"Shin Godzilla\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jPNShaWZMpVF0iQ7j1dvTuZLD20.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a massive, gilled monster emerges from the deep and tears through the city, the government scrambles to save its citizens. A rag-tag team of volunteers cuts through a web of red tape to uncover the monster's weakness and its mysterious ties to a foreign superpower. But time is not on their side - the greatest catastrophe to ever befall the world is about to evolve right before their very eyes.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":72190,\"title\":\"World War Z\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCnVdvExw6UWSeQfr0tUH3jr4qG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kg2FOT2Oe5PSCgs3L4vLel6B7ck.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460458,\"title\":\"Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7uRbWOXxpWDMtnsd2PF3clu65jc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wYtEvBmpBRXPdwGgr1gcWiwJSI7.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Once the booming home of pharmaceutical giant Umbrella Corporation, Raccoon City is now a dying Midwestern town. The company’s exodus left the city a wasteland…with great evil brewing below the surface. When that evil is unleashed, the townspeople are forever…changed…and a small group of survivors must work together to uncover the truth behind Umbrella and make it through the night.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":345940,\"title\":\"The Meg\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eyWICPcxOuTcDDDbTMOZawoOn8d.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ibKeXahq4JD63z6uWQphqoJLvNw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A deep sea submersible pilot revisits his past fears in the Mariana Trench, and accidentally unleashes the seventy foot ancestor of the Great White Shark believed to be extinct.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1196067,\"title\":\"Worldbreaker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ahj1JU8r0uJv7QII5Uj7tKzbEsC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMItMzDOyrfQGZsMWRM9tdxq5cV.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Five years ago, a tear in the fabric of reality brought creatures to our world from an alternate dimension bent on our destruction. A father hides his daughter on an island to keep her safe while he prepares her for survival and the battles to come. But when the world is about to break, no place is safe.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":440,\"title\":\"Aliens vs Predator: Requiem\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5iTwPDNtvK6ZZF607BHBbU3HO0B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jXntuh47VtKLeoyBQ268rv24Igw.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a horrifying PredAlien crash-lands near a small Colorado town, killing everyone it encounters and producing countless Alien offspring, a lone Predator arrives to \\\"clean up\\\" the infestation.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36648,\"title\":\"Blade: Trinity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6f7iXvPOnf83MaLB1JmPzUor1rr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/63eAFgJtN6ZTyFFzlAOoZLhlYqc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For years, Blade has fought against the vampires in the cover of the night. But now, after falling into the crosshairs of the FBI, he is forced out into the daylight, where he is driven to join forces with a clan of human vampire hunters he never knew existed—The Nightstalkers. Together with Abigail and Hannibal, two deftly trained Nightstalkers, Blade follows a trail of blood to the ancient creature that is also hunting him—the original vampire, Dracula.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5842,\"title\":\"Versus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dEk6Fpm4lkEBQBVpzTOLau7qgR9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZjRoASxOOyafFruGRuDBzL7dZ8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of ruthless gangsters, an unknown woman and an escaped convict have met, in The Forest of Resurrection, the 444th portal to the other side. Their troubles start when those once killed and buried in the forest come back from the dead.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":648043,\"title\":\"The Driver\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cCO26pPZDnZ4SRuqV2cwyuDKBfs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/paxjgQ7I2oALdi85F5qw8PBiO2q.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a plague of the undead decimates human life on Earth, a former hit man (Mark Dacascos), his wife, and daughter live quietly in a survivalist compound. But when their base is attacked, a massive explosion summons a swarm of the undead. They escape and must seek out the Haven, a rumored sanctuary up north, while the father teaches his daughter to shoot, drive, and survive before time runs out.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272625,\"title\":\"Charlie Bit My Finger\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Director Jeff Chan re-made the classic viral video 'Charlie Bit My Finger' in a horror film style.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"BxDIEyQAg-E\",\"name\":\"Toxin (2014) | Trailer | Doug Chapman | Kyra Zagorski | Giles Panton | Philip Granger | Dave Cote\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}